      "writtenOn": "2025-04-16T21:09:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is correct.\n\nstatus!\u003dSuccess means the `PopErrorScope` call itself had an error.\n\ntype\u003d\u003dOutOfMemory/Validation/Internal means the `PopErrorScope` call succeeded and the scope caught an error that we need to report to the application.\n\ntype\u003d\u003dNoError means the call succeeded and the scope caught no error.\n\ntype\u003d\u003dUnknown is a corner case. I\u0027m not sure, but I think it never happens, so it could be an `ASSERT`, but reject is fine.",
      "parentUuid": "dd12c19a_17b19adf",
